rooms_desc ({"The gods look at you with distaste!  \"What a mess!\" You hear one of them mutter. \"Here let me fix that!\" Another booms.***************************  ZZZAAAPPPP  *********************************You die.You feel a strange sensation.You see your body from above.Your spirit leaves the burnt husk that was your body and floats tword thesky!You notice the diffrent clouds as you float up!Then suddenly you notice a cloud that bears amazing resmblance to a house!You grab hold of a bit of cloud and pull yourself to a stop.Your at the entrance to a house!   You feel compelled to look at the house.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
